<item><title>Gambia Press Union urges probe after court reporter says officer tried to seize phone</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-press-union-urges-probe-after-court-reporter-says-72ca51/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-press-union-urges-probe-after-court-reporter-says-72ca51/</guid><category>Gambia</category><description>Sainabou Sambou said a prison officer confronted her outside Bundung High Court after she photographed an accused person.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:40:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gm.jpg" length="31578" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Gambia teachers threaten sit-down strike over unpaid allowances</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-teachers-threaten-sit-down-strike-over-unpaid-5cc94a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-teachers-threaten-sit-down-strike-over-unpaid-5cc94a/</guid><category>Gambia</category><description>The education ministry admits delays in hardship and double-shift payments for September to November and expects to pay by 30 November.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 11:50:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-teachers-threaten-sit-down-strike-over-unpaid-5cc94a/share.jpg" length="42694" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gm/gambia-teachers-threaten-sit-down-strike-over-unpaid-5cc94a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
